Z||000004||Fierowrecker||12-02-2001||02:41 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 84 2in1:<BR><B>one more question on this topic. would a flat tappet springed head on a roller block cause the motor go into valve float and heat up the exhaust and cause it to pop out of the intake and the exhaust.-B-<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>No...<BR>Chances are, you need to pull the lifter cover and look at the lifters...<BR>Several of my roller lifters had come apart, so I used a standard cam and lifters to replace them...<BR>crash...<BR>||||reg||1
